+# F1.3 — Reactive Room + Compose
+
+Date: 2026-11-14 · Base commit: `a316f53`
+
+## Scope delivered
+
+- Addon `ui/notes` (beta, generatable) depends on `storage/room` and `ui/navigation`.
+- Generated `NotesUiState`, `NotesViewModel`, `NotesScreen`, `NoteEditorScreen`.
+- ViewModel with `StateFlow`, `viewModelScope`, validation, error handling and UDF.
+- Room DAO reactive `Flow`, no main-thread queries.
+- Navigation 3 integration with `Notes` and `NoteEditor` routes.
+- Web preview remains token-based.
+
+## Validation
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| `bun run typecheck` | PASS |
+| `bun test packages tests` | PASS: 94 tests, 570 assertions |
+| `bun run check:astro` | PASS |
+| `bun run templates:check` | PASS |
+| `bun run build` | PASS |
+| Notes project `assembleDebug` | PASS |
+| Notes `testDebugUnitTest` | PASS |
+| Notes `lintDebug` | PASS |
+| Notes `compileDebugAndroidTestKotlin` | PASS |
+| Room+Notes+UI combination | PASS |
+| Determinism API/CLI | PASS |
+
+## Known limitations
+
+- Instrumented UI/CRUD tests compiled but not executed (no device/emulator).
+- Room remains beta due to lack of runtime persistence evidence.
+- No ViewModel JVM tests yet; added only generated-code and composition tests.
+EOF
+wc -c docs/phases/F1.3-reactive-room-compose.md
\ No newline at end of file
